<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="page-section max-w-3xl pt-8 md:pt-14">
    <p class="section-label">Privacy policy</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="article-prose mt-10">
      <p>
        This English version is provided for convenience. In case of discrepancies, the German
        version of the <a href="/privacy">Datenschutzerklärung</a> applies.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Privacy at a glance</h2>

      <p>
        This website is a personal portfolio website. It does not use analytics tools, marketing
        trackers, advertising cookies, or tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <p>
        Personal data may be processed if you contact me directly, for example by email. Technical
        data may also be processed automatically when you visit the website, insofar as this is
        necessary to provide the website.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Controller</h2>

      <p>The controller responsible for data processing on this website is:</p>

      <p>
        Faid Rihan<br />
        Willhelm-Riehl-Straße 43<br />
        80687 Munich<br />
        Germany
      </p>

      <p>
        Phone: <a href="tel:+4917621570302">+49 176 2157 0302</a><br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:faid.r03@gmail.com">faid.r03@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>3. Hosting</h2>

      <p>
        This website is self-hosted on a server operated by the website owner. No external web
        hosting provider is used for delivering this website.
      </p>

      <p>
        When the website is accessed, technically necessary data may be processed in order to
        deliver the website to your browser. This may include the IP address, date and time of the
        request, requested URL, referrer, browser and operating system information, and transferred
        data volume.
      </p>

      <p>
        The processing is based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. The legitimate interest lies in the secure,
        stable, and error-free provision of the website.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Server log files</h2>

      <p>
        The server may automatically process information that your browser transmits. This may
        include:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>browser type and browser version</li>
        <li>operating system</li>
        <li>referrer URL</li>
        <li>hostname of the accessing device</li>
        <li>time of the server request</li>
        <li>IP address</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This data is not combined with other data sources. Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR,
        as there is a legitimate interest in the technical delivery, security, and stability of the
        website.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Cookies and local storage</h2>

      <p>This website does not use tracking cookies, marketing cookies, or analytics cookies.</p>

      <p>
        If you use the theme switcher, your selected light or dark theme may be stored in your
        browser's local storage. This allows the website to remember your preferred appearance on
        future visits.
      </p>

      <p>
        This storage only happens when you use the theme switcher. You can delete the stored
        preference at any time through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>6. External services</h2>

      <p>
        This website currently does not embed external analytics, tracking, marketing services, or
        external media content.
      </p>

      <p>
        The website may contain links to external websites, such as GitHub or project pages. When
        visiting external links, the privacy policies of the respective providers apply.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Contact by email or phone</h2>

      <p>
        If you contact me by email or phone, the personal data contained in your request will be
        processed for the purpose of handling your inquiry.
      </p>

      <p>
        Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR if your request is related to pre-contractual
        measures or a contractual relationship. In all other cases, processing is based on my
        legitimate interest in handling inquiries addressed to me under Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Your rights</h2>

      <p>
        You have the right to request information about your stored personal data, correction,
        deletion, restriction of processing, and objection to certain types of processing. You also
        have the right to lodge a complaint with a competent data protection supervisory authority.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Date and source</h2>

      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US")}</p>

      <p>
        This English version is based on the German privacy policy generated with e-recht24 and
        adapted to the actual technical implementation of this website.
      </p>

      <p>
        Source:
        <a href="https://www.e-recht24.de" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          https://www.e-recht24.de
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
